    "documentation": "https://github.com/yaml/libyaml/blob/0.2.5/include/yaml.h",
    "documentation_note": "The pinned include/yaml.h documents yaml_parser_set_input_string (input string and its size; the string must outlive the parser) and yaml_parser_load, which composes the next document of the stream into a yaml_document_t node graph and returns an empty document (no root node) at the end of the stream.",
